ull,"shot":"Drive","zone":"Mid-off","speedKph":null},{"innings":1,"over":"7.2","batter":"V Kohli","bowler":"DJ Bravo","runs":0,"text":"and again. That angle is working. Kohli looks to open up the leg-side field this time, but is beaten by a short delivery angling across","isWicket":false,"isBoundary":false,"dismissal":null,"length":"Short","line":"Outside off","variation":null,"shot":null,"zone":null,"speedKph":null},{"innings":1,"over":"7.1","batter":"V Kohli","bowler":"DJ Bravo","runs":0,"text":"bowls quick, shortish, angled across. Beats Kohli, who is charging at him","isWicket":false,"isBoundary":false,"dismissal":null,"length":null,"line":"Outside off","variation":null,"shot":null,"zone":null,"speedKph":null},{"innings":1,"over":"6.7","batter":"MC Henriques","bowler":"MM Sharma","runs":4,"text":"he goes full and wide, with his field, but Henriques ends up slicing his drive square of third man for four","isWicket":false,"isBoundary":true,"dismissal":null,"length":"Full","line":"Wide outside off","variation":null,"shot":"Drive","zone":"Third man","speedKph":null},{"innings":1,"over":"6.6","batter":"MC Henriques","bowler":"MM Sharma","runs":4,"text":"he has picked the slower ball up this time, which ends up being a half-volley on off, and he has driven this over extra cover for four","isWicket":false,"isBoundary":true,"dismissal":null,"length":"Half-volley","line":"On off stump","variation":"Slower ball","shot":"Drive","zone":"Extra cover","speedKph":null},{"innings":1,"over":"6.5","batter":"MC Henriques","bowler":"MM Sharma","runs":4,"text":"full toss, hit wide of long-off, and speeds up further off the practice pitches near the boundary. Jadeja, running from long-off, can't get to it","isWicket":false,"isBoundary":true,"dismissal":null,"length":"Full toss","line":null,"variation":null,"shot":null,"zone":"Long-off","speedKph":null},{"innings":1,"over":"6.4","batter":"MC Henriques","bowler":"MM Sharma","runs":1,"text":"full and wide, beats Henriques' drive, but it